{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00487","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 一 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於昭上穹，临下有光。\n羽翼五佐，周流八荒。\n谁其飨之，时文对敭。\n虞经夏典，兹礼未遑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}